## 3.4 Esempi Python rapidi
```python
# Self-checking 2-su-5
cod = "10100"  # 5
print(cod.count("1") == 2)  # True

# Gray ↔ binario
def gray_to_bin(g):
    b = g
    while g > 0:
        g >>= 1
        b ^= g
    return b
print(gray_to_bin(0b111))  # 5 (101)
```

